title: Parse hook JSON output and exit codes
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:34:23Z"
---
Parse hook stdout as JSON when possible. Exit code semantics: 0=success (stdout may contain JSON with decisions/context), 2=block (stderr sent to agent), other=error (stderr shown to user, execution continues). Extract permissionDecision, additionalContext, updatedInput from JSON per Claude Code schema.